{"id":"redash","name":"Memory of Goddess (NKS)","folder":"24_redash","intro":null,"help":[],"tables":[{"name":"Mission","rows":115},{"name":"Guide","rows":95},{"name":"Balloon","rows":174},{"name":"Character","rows":27},{"name":"CharacterBurst","rows":24},{"name":"CharacterLevel","rows":20},{"name":"CharacterSkillTree","rows":156},{"name":"CoinSkillSlot","rows":40},{"name":"CoinSkillStore","rows":200},{"name":"CoinStore","rows":20},{"name":"Collection","rows":56},{"name":"CommonSettings","rows":11},{"name":"Dialog","rows":609},{"name":"DropList","rows":38},{"name":"GachaBox","rows":3},{"name":"GachaList","rows":109},{"name":"Items","rows":492},{"name":"ItemsAction","rows":1146},{"name":"ItemsStat","rows":264},{"name":"Monster","rows":720},{"name":"MonsterAction","rows":2114},{"name":"SpawnGroup","rows":854},{"name":"SpawnTimeLine","rows":1540},{"name":"Stage","rows":50},{"name":"StageTileSet","rows":178}],"view":{"summary":"MEMORY OF GODDESS: a survivor-style shooter. Drag a Goddess Squad member around while Raptures swarm in, level up with Battle Data to collect weapons and modules, outlast the stage timer and kill the boss.","overview":[{"type":"facts","title":"How a run works","items":[["Goal","Survive until the stage timer runs out (5 to 30 minutes) and defeat the boss. The timer stops while a mid-boss is on the field."],["Controls","Tap and drag to move; your weapons fire on their own. Double-tap the character (or the Burst button) for her Burst."],["Losing","The run ends when HP hits 0 (EX Edition: revive with Coins if you have revivals left)."],["Levelling up","Battle Data dropped by Raptures is EXP. Each level offers a random choice of weapons and modules; picking one you own levels it up (Lv. 5 is max). Level 1 needs 14 EXP, level 10 needs 42, and every level from 20 on needs 166."],["Mid-bosses","Tougher Raptures appear at fixed times; they drop a Manufacturer Arms box with free weapon / module upgrades."],["After a hit","You are invincible for 0.5 s."],["Between runs","Coins picked up in runs carry over: spend them on each character’s skill tree (refundable) and, in EX, on character unlocks and the Coin upgrade store."],["Relics","Some stages hide a relic on the map. Relics unlock characters and, carried by the right character to the end of the right stage, play her ending story."]]},{"type":"facts","title":"Versions","items":[["M.O.G.",["The original event: 5 themes of 2 stages plus a 30-minute Challenge Stage, 6 characters.",{"scene":"1ann_mini_prologue","label":"Battle Simulation?"}]],["M.O.G. EX Edition",["The Arcade version: adds Exia, the Mine theme, a “Ø” stage per theme, Challenge Stages α and β, EX. combined weapons, Coin upgrades, revives and rerolls.",{"scene":"mog2_prologue","label":"The Legendary Game"}]],["Union Ranking","Ordinary Raptures killed in the Challenge Stage (Challenge Stage - β in EX) count for a ranking inside your Union. Not counted in the Archives."]]},{"type":"gallery","title":"Characters","items":[{"img":"nks_character_c220_ui_sprite","caption":"Snow White"},{"img":"nks_character_c233_ui_sprite","caption":"Dorothy"},{"img":"nks_character_c222_ui_sprite","caption":"Scarlet"},{"img":"nks_character_c221_ui_sprite","caption":"Rapunzel"},{"img":"nks_character_c470_ui_sprite","caption":"Red Hood"},{"img":"nks_character_hidden_ui_sprite","caption":"RE : THE HOOD"},{"img":"nks_character_c210_ui_sprite","caption":"Exia"}]},{"type":"gallery","title":"Themes","items":[{"img":"nks_stagetheme_01","caption":"Snowy Land"},{"img":"nks_stagetheme_02","caption":"Military Base"},{"img":"nks_stagetheme_03","caption":"Desert"},{"img":"nks_stagetheme_04","caption":"Plain"},{"img":"nks_stagetheme_05","caption":"Simulation Room"},{"img":"nks_stagetheme_05","caption":"Challenge Stage"},{"img":"nks_stagetheme_06","caption":"Mine"}]}],"pages":[{"id":"guide","title":"How to play","group":null,"count":null},{"id":"char-1","title":"Snow White","group":"Characters","count":null},{"id":"char-2","title":"Dorothy","gro